	(text "Per input (ARCHITECTURE.md 5.2-5.3): 1.5 k pull-up to +4.5 V (switch wetting current) and the original 39 k + 47 pF filter, plus 68 k to\nground so the 3.3 V 74HC165 sees 2.8 V (open) or 0 V (closed). Connector pin to D-number order follows the original drawing: check it with a meter.\nThe 8 DIP switches are read through the last 74HC165 of the chain (U14), whose serial input is tied low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
